===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Tropius|6}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*'''Cutting Wind''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX FireRed & LeafGreen|Pidgeotto|45}} from {{TCG|EX FireRed & LeafGreen}}.
